00:49:44,040 --> 00:49:44,600
in the midst

963
00:49:44,600 --> 00:49:45,420
of the temptation

964
00:49:45,420 --> 00:49:46,140
to take on

965
00:49:46,140 --> 00:49:47,100
any other identity.

966
00:49:47,100 --> 00:49:49,200
For the accuser

967
00:49:49,200 --> 00:49:50,380
to say anything else

968
00:49:50,380 --> 00:49:50,860
about us,

969
00:49:50,860 --> 00:49:52,360
may we hold tightly

970
00:49:52,360 --> 00:49:54,100
to this identity

971
00:49:54,100 --> 00:49:56,040
that we are

972
00:49:56,040 --> 00:49:57,040
sheep

973
00:49:57,040 --> 00:49:59,500
in your flock.

974
00:49:59,500 --> 00:50:02,660
God,

975
00:50:02,660 --> 00:50:03,320
even though we walk

976
00:50:03,320 --> 00:50:03,840
through the valley

977
00:50:03,840 --> 00:50:04,280
of the shadow

978
00:50:04,280 --> 00:50:04,620
of death,

979
00:50:04,620 --> 00:50:05,280
you are with us.

980
00:50:05,280 --> 00:50:06,600
Your rod

981
00:50:06,600 --> 00:50:07,160
and your staff,

982
00:50:07,160 --> 00:50:07,820
they comfort us.

983
00:50:07,820 --> 00:50:08,660
May we experience

984
00:50:08,660 --> 00:50:09,740
that comfort this morning.

985
00:50:09,740 --> 00:50:12,720
It's in Jesus' name

986
00:50:12,720 --> 00:50:13,340
I pray.

987
00:50:13,340 --> 00:50:14,700
Amen.

988
00:50:14,700 --> 00:50:17,460
Feel free to hang around

989
00:50:17,460 --> 00:50:17,900
and pray.

990
00:50:17,900 --> 00:50:19,200
Come up to the prayer room.

991
00:50:19,200 --> 00:50:21,020
You're dismissed

992
00:50:21,020 --> 00:50:21,780
to pick up your children

993
00:50:21,780 --> 00:50:22,120
as well.

994
00:50:22,120 --> 00:50:22,520
Thank you.

995
00:50:24,100 --> 00:50:25,100
Thank you.

996
00:50:54,100 --> 00:50:55,100
Thank you.
